# Test cases for demo.nlu. Run them with:
#   ./build/nlu_script_cli --test examples/demo.nlu examples/demo.test
# Each sentence is followed by the indented output expected for it; '-' means
# no label matches.

# card:lost, card:freeze
Report a lost Visa credit card
    card:lost:Report a lost <card brand="VISA" type="CREDIT">Visa credit card</card>
I lost my debit card
    card:lost:I lost my <card type="DEBIT">debit card</card>
마스터 체크카드를 분실했어요
    card:lost:<card brand="MASTERCARD" type="DEBIT">마스터 체크카드</card>를 분실했어요
체크카드을 분실했어요
    -
Freeze my card ending in 1234
    card:freeze:Freeze my card ending in <last4>1234</last4>
끝자리 5678 카드 정지해주세요
    card:freeze:끝자리 <last4>5678</last4> 카드 정지해주세요

# transfer:send, transfer:status
Send 50 dollars to Alex
    transfer:send:Send <amount currency="USD">50</amount> dollars to <recipient>Alex</recipient>
엄마한테 3만 원 보내줘
    transfer:send:<recipient>엄마</recipient>한테 <amount currency="KRW"><KO_NUMBER value="30000">3만</KO_NUMBER></amount> 원 보내줘
동생에게 삼만 오천 원 송금해줘
    transfer:send:<recipient>동생</recipient>에게 <amount currency="KRW"><KO_NUMBER value="35000">삼만 오천</KO_NUMBER></amount> 원 송금해줘
엄마한테 많이 원 보내줘
    -
송금이 안 들어갔어요
    transfer:status:송금이 안 들어갔어요
did my transfer go through
    transfer:status:did my transfer go through

# payment:refund, payment:installment
환불해주세요
    payment:refund:환불해주세요
스타벅스 결제 환불해줘
    payment:refund:<merchant>스타벅스</merchant> 결제 환불해줘
refund my payment at Corner Bakery
    payment:refund:refund my payment at <merchant>Corner Bakery</merchant>
3 개월 할부로 바꿔주세요
    payment:installment:<NUMBER>3</NUMBER> 개월 할부로 바꿔주세요
split it into 6 monthly payments
    payment:installment:split it into <NUMBER>6</NUMBER> monthly payments

# exchange:rate
오늘 달러 환율 알려줘
    exchange:rate:오늘 <currency code="USD">달러</currency> 환율 알려줘
what is the yen exchange rate
    exchange:rate:what is the <currency code="JPY">yen</currency> exchange rate

# account:close:product and account:close. Savings and deposits go to
# account:close:product; account:close skips any account name mentioning them,
# so a name that only contains one matches neither.
적금 해지하고 싶어요
    account:close:product:<product value="savings">적금</product> 해지하고 싶어요
적금를 해지하고 싶어요
    -
정기적금을 해지해주세요
    account:close:product:<product value="savings">정기적금</product>을 해지해주세요
close my fixed deposit account
    account:close:product:close my <product value="deposit">fixed deposit</product> account
청약통장을 해지해주세요
    account:close:<account>청약통장</account>을 해지해주세요
close my brokerage account
    account:close:close my <account>brokerage</account> account
close my joint savings account
    -
deposit 해지해주세요
    account:close:product:<product value="deposit">deposit</product> 해지해주세요
savings 통장을 해지해주세요
    -

# account:phone, account:login, account:password:reset
휴대폰 번호 010-9876-5432로 변경해주세요
    account:phone:휴대폰 번호 <TELNUM>010-9876-5432</TELNUM>로 변경해주세요
change my phone number to 01098765432
    account:phone:change my phone number to <TELNUM>01098765432</TELNUM>
로그인이 안 돼요
    account:login:로그인이 안 돼요
I can't sign in
    account:login:I can't sign in
재설정 비밀번호 해주세요
    account:password:reset:재설정 비밀번호 해주세요
reset password
    account:password:reset:reset password
I forgot my PIN
    account:password:reset:I forgot my PIN

# agent:connect, and no match
상담원 연결해주세요
    agent:connect:상담원 연결해주세요
talk to a human
    agent:connect:talk to a human
thank you
    -

# agent:callback, with DATETIME
내일 오후 3시에 전화주세요
    agent:callback:<DATETIME day_offset="+1" part_of_day="PM" hour="15">내일 오후 3시</DATETIME>에 전화주세요
다음 주 월요일 오전 10시 반에 연락해주세요
    agent:callback:<DATETIME week_offset="+1" weekday="MON" part_of_day="AM" hour="10" minute="30">다음 주 월요일 오전 10시 반</DATETIME>에 연락해주세요
3월 5일 저녁 7시에 전화해주세요
    agent:callback:<DATETIME month="3" day="5" part_of_day="EVENING" hour="19">3월 5일 저녁 7시</DATETIME>에 전화해주세요
call me back tomorrow at 3pm
    agent:callback:call me back <DATETIME day_offset="+1" hour="15" part_of_day="PM">tomorrow at 3pm</DATETIME>
call me back next friday morning
    agent:callback:call me back <DATETIME week_offset="+1" weekday="FRI" part_of_day="MORNING">next friday morning</DATETIME>
call me back at noon
    agent:callback:call me back at <DATETIME hour="12" minute="0">noon</DATETIME>
내일 3시부터 5시까지 연락해주세요
    agent:callback:<DATETIME day_offset="+1" hour="3" end_hour="5">내일 3시부터 5시까지</DATETIME> 연락해주세요
call me back in 2 hours
    agent:callback:call me back <DATETIME hour_offset="+2">in 2 hours</DATETIME>
